.TH mnnn-net-start 1  "mnnn-net-start 2.6.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-net\-start \- Run this node in the foreground until Ctrl\-C (or \-\-for SECS, or `mnnn net stop`)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn net start\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-listen\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-mdns\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-relay\-server\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-for\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run this node in the foreground until Ctrl\-C (or \-\-for SECS, or `mnnn net stop`)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<PORT>\fR
TCP and QUIC port (default from settings: 4741; 0 picks one)
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-listen\fR \fI<ADDR>\fR
Listen on these addresses instead (multiaddr, repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-mdns\fR
Do not look for peers on the local network
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-relay\-server\fR
Relay traffic for other nodes (and say so)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-for\fR \fI<SECS>\fR
Stop after this many seconds
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.6.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
